---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CodeBlock from '../../components/CodeBlock.astro';
---

<Layout title="server">
  <p class="small-label fade-up">Commands</p>
  <h1 class="fade-up d1">server</h1>

  <h2>Usage</h2>
  <CodeBlock>
    <code>junkyard server</code>
  </CodeBlock>

  <h2>Flags</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Flag</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>--port</code></td><td><code>45845</code></td><td>Port to listen on</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--storage</code></td><td><code>~/.junkyard/tmp</code></td><td>Directory for staged files</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Example</h2>
  <CodeBlock>
    <code>junkyard server --port 8080 --storage /tmp/junkyard</code>
  </CodeBlock>

  <h2>Exit codes</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>0</code></td><td>success</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>1</code></td><td>generic error</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>2</code></td><td>invalid arguments</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>3</code></td><td>network error</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Notes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Storage is an in-memory map plus a temp directory. Nothing persists past expiry.</li>
    <li>A background goroutine sweeps expired codes every 30 seconds.</li>
    <li>The server streams files. It never buffers a whole upload in memory.</li>
  </ul>
</Layout>